Saya tidak bawa payung.

251
00:13:07,130 --> 00:13:11,330
Saya juga tidak. Repot juga ya.

252
00:13:11,353 --> 00:13:15,753
Mari kita berteduh sebentar di sini.

253
00:13:15,776 --> 00:13:18,143
Baiklah.

254
00:13:18,166 --> 00:13:21,933
Tapi kayaknya hujannya belum reda juga.

255
00:13:21,956 --> 00:13:25,289
Berapa lama lagi ke stasiun?

256
00:13:25,312 --> 00:13:29,316
Dari sini jalan kaki sekitar lima belas menit.

257
00:13:29,339 --> 00:13:32,630
Lima belas menit jauh juga ya.

258
00:13:32,654 --> 00:13:34,220
Nanti basah kuyup.

259
00:13:34,243 --> 00:13:37,677
Di dekat sini ada minimarket, lho.

260
00:13:37,700 --> 00:13:41,433
Bisa beli payung di minimarket?

261
00:13:41,456 --> 00:13:45,307
Bisa, ada payung plastik murah.

262
00:13:45,331 --> 00:13:47,664
Payung plastik?

263
00:13:47,687 --> 00:13:52,221
Payung murah yang terbuat dari plastik, biasanya berwarna putih.

264
00:13:52,244 --> 00:13:54,889
Oh, saya mengerti.

265
00:13:54,912 --> 00:13:58,146
Minimarketnya di mana?

266
00:13:58,169 --> 00:14:02,102
Belok di pojok itu, lalu sebentar lagi sampai.

267
00:14:02,125 --> 00:14:05,170
Kalau lari sekitar satu menit, ya?

268
00:14:05,194 --> 00:14:09,481
Iya, dekat sekali. Ayo kita lari!

269
00:14:09,504 --> 00:14:11,237
Baiklah.

270
00:14:11,260 --> 00:14:13,194
Sudah siap?

271
00:14:13,217 --> 00:14:15,817
Sudah, ayo!

272
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:17,573
Ayo lari.

273
00:14:17,596 --> 00:14:19,683
Ayo cepat.

274
00:14:19,706 --> 00:14:21,206
Adegan 8: Memeriksa Barang Hilang

275
00:14:21,206 --> 00:14:23,102
Maaf.

276
00:14:23,126 --> 00:14:26,782
Apakah ini sopir taksi tadi?

277
00:14:26,805 --> 00:14:30,609
Iya, betul. Ada apa?

278
00:14:30,633 --> 00:14:34,600
Kayaknya saya jatuhin paspor.

279
00:14:34,623 --> 00:14:37,463
Ada di dalam mobil?

280
00:14:37,486 --> 00:14:41,536
Mungkin di atas kursi atau di lantai.

281
00:14:41,560 --> 00:14:43,595
Baiklah.

282
00:14:43,619 --> 00:14:47,055
Saya lihat kursi belakang dulu ya.

283
00:14:47,078 --> 00:14:48,777
Tolong ya.

284
00:14:48,800 --> 00:14:51,267
Saya benar-benar panik.

285
00:14:51,290 --> 00:14:55,265
Eh, ada sesuatu di bawah kursi nih.

286
00:14:55,288 --> 00:14:57,255
Benarkah?

287
00:14:57,278 --> 00:14:59,094
Boleh saya lihat?

288
00:14:59,118 --> 00:15:01,151
Ini?

289
00:15:01,174 --> 00:15:03,974
Ini kayak buku merah.

290
00:15:03,997 --> 00:15:08,442
Bukan, itu bukan buku saya.

291
00:15:08,465 --> 00:15:12,322
Coba saya lihat saku pintunya.

292
00:15:12,346 --> 00:15:14,397
Ada?

293
00:15:14,420 --> 00:15:18,063
Tidak, tidak ada di sini.

294
00:15:18,087 --> 00:15:20,053
Bagaimana ini.

295
00:15:20,076 --> 00:15:23,760
Kalau paspor hilang, saya gak bisa naik pesawat.

296
00:15:23,783 --> 00:15:28,017
Coba cek lagi di dalam tas.

297
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:31,378
Tasnya sudah saya cek tadi.

298
00:15:31,402 --> 00:15:34,640
Bagaimana dengan saku kecilnya?

299
00:15:34,663 --> 00:15:37,152
Saku kecil?

300
00:15:37,176 --> 00:15:39,409
Ah, ada!

301
00:15:39,432 --> 00:15:41,565
Ada di sini!

302
00:15:41,588 --> 00:15:43,388
Syukurlah.

303
00:15:43,411 --> 00:15:45,978
Syukurlah ketemu.

304
00:15:46,001 --> 00:15:49,134
Maaf banget ya.

305
00:15:49,157 --> 00:15:50,657
Adegan 9: Cara Mengatasi Kebocoran Air di Toilet

306
00:15:50,657 --> 00:15:54,191
Halo, ini perusahaan pengelola?

307
00:15:54,214 --> 00:15:56,816
Iya, betul.

308
00:15:56,839 --> 00:15:58,613
Ada apa?

309
00:15:58,636 --> 00:16:02,203
Air di toilet tidak berhenti mengalir.

310
00:16:02,226 --> 00:16:05,294
Airnya terus mengalir?

311
00:16:05,317 --> 00:16:09,084
Iya, airnya banyak sekali.

312
00:16:09,107 --> 00:16:11,707
Lantainya basah?

313
00:16:11,730 --> 00:16:15,863
Iya, lantainya penuh air.

314
00:16:15,886 --> 00:16:17,553
Baiklah.

315
00:16:17,576 --> 00:16:21,109
Pertama, tutup keran utamanya dulu.

316
00:16:21,132 --> 00:16:23,699
Keran utama...?

317
00:16:23,722 --> 00:16:27,522
Maaf, saya tidak tahu.

318
00:16:27,545 --> 00:16:32,345
Yang kecil untuk mematikan air, ada pegangannya.

319
00:16:32,368 --> 00:16:34,934
Biasanya ada di bawah tangki toilet.

320
00:16:34,957 --> 00:16:37,557
Di bawah tangki...

321
00:16:37,580 --> 00:16:40,514
Ini ya?

322
00:16:40,537 --> 00:16:44,070
Tapi kok keras, gak bisa diputar.

323
00:16:44,093 --> 00:16:46,696
Punya alat?

324
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:48,795
Alat?

325
00:16:48,818 --> 00:16:53,384
Maaf, saya tidak mengerti bahasanya.

326
00:16:53,407 --> 00:16:57,343
Seperti obeng atau kunci inggris.

327
00:16:57,367 --> 00:17:00,824
Tidak, saya tidak punya alat.

328
00:17:00,848 --> 00:17:02,814
Baiklah.

329
00:17:02,837 --> 00:17:06,087
Tukang reparasi akan segera ke sana.

330
00:17:06,111 --> 00:17:08,524
Berapa lama sampai datang?

331
00:17:08,548 --> 00:17:12,036
Bisa sampai di sana dalam waktu sekitar tiga puluh menit.

332
00:17:12,059 --> 00:17:14,912
Tolong datang lebih cepat.

333
00:17:14,935 --> 00:17:17,701
Air keluar ke dalam kamar.

334
00:17:17,724 --> 00:17:19,891
Saya akan menyuruhnya pergi dengan segera.

335
00:17:19,914 --> 00:17:22,482
Silakan lap airnya dengan handuk.

336
00:17:22,506 --> 00:17:24,577
Baiklah.

337
00:17:24,600 --> 00:17:26,979
Menggunakan handuk.

338
00:17:27,003 --> 00:17:30,736
Saya akan segera pergi, jadi tolong tunggu sebentar.

339
00:17:30,759 --> 00:17:33,126
Tolong bantu ya.

340
00:17:33,149 --> 00:17:34,649
Scene 10: Cara Menangani Saat Gempa Bumi / How to Respond During an Earthquake

341
00:17:34,649 --> 00:17:37,582
Aduh, gempa!

342
00:17:37,605 --> 00:17:39,699
Goyangannya kuat.

343
00:17:39,723 --> 00:17:41,856
Tenanglah.

344
00:17:41,879 --> 00:17:45,049
Masuklah ke bawah meja.

345
00:17:45,073 --> 00:17:48,212
Takut, harus bagaimana ya?

346
00:17:48,235 --> 00:17:50,082
Tidak apa-apa.

347
00:17:50,106 --> 00:17:52,873
Lindungi kepalamu.

348
00:17:52,896 --> 00:17:56,181
Goyangannya sangat kuat.

349
00:17:56,204 --> 00:18:00,541
Akan segera reda, jadi jangan bergerak dulu.

350
00:18:00,565 --> 00:18:02,898
Akan reda...?

351
00:18:02,921 --> 00:18:07,321
Maksudnya gempa akan berhenti.

352
00:18:07,344 --> 00:18:10,615
Oh, goyangannya sudah berhenti.

353
00:18:10,639 --> 00:18:13,135
Syukurlah.

354
00:18:13,159 --> 00:18:15,425
Apakah ada yang terluka?

355
00:18:15,448 --> 00:18:18,248
Tidak, saya baik-baik saja.

356
00:18:18,271 --> 00:18:20,838
Tapi, saya masih takut.

357
00:18:20,861 --> 00:18:23,828
Selanjutnya, saya harus pergi ke mana?

358
00:18:23,851 --> 00:18:26,984
Apakah lebih baik keluar?

359
00:18:27,007 --> 00:18:31,740
Tidak, di luar ada bahaya pecahan kaca yang jatuh.

360
00:18:31,763 --> 00:18:34,763
Kalau begitu, tetap di sini saja?

361
00:18:34,786 --> 00:18:39,120
Nyalakan TV untuk memeriksa informasi.

362
00:18:39,142 --> 00:18:40,909
Informasi?

363
00:18:40,932 --> 00:18:43,509
Maksudnya berita.

364
00:18:43,533 --> 00:18:46,171
Mari kita lihat berita tentang gempa.

365
00:18:46,194 --> 00:18:48,527
Baiklah.

366
00:18:48,550 --> 00:18:50,750
Apakah tsunami akan datang?

367
00:18:50,773 --> 00:18:55,632
Tempat ini jauh dari laut, jadi tidak apa-apa.

368
00:18:55,655 --> 00:18:57,990
Apakah kita pergi ke tempat evakuasi?

369
00:18:58,014 --> 00:18:59,947
Tempat evakuasi?

370
00:18:59,970 --> 00:19:03,170
Maksudnya tempat yang aman.

371
00:19:03,193 --> 00:19:05,360
Kita pergi ke sekolah dasar.

372
00:19:05,383 --> 00:19:08,149
Bisa tolong temani saya ke sana?

373
00:19:08,172 --> 00:19:11,572
Ya, mari kita pergi bersama.

374
00:19:11,595 --> 00:19:13,873
Bawalah barang-barangmu.

375
00:19:13,897 --> 00:19:15,744
Baiklah.

376
00:19:15,767 --> 00:19:18,101
Terima kasih.